  "system": {
    "slug": "husked-geth",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 5
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>A Geth Trooper platform corrupted and reanimated by Reaper technology after battlefield destruction, known informally as a \"Geth Zombie.\" The Reaper signal overwrites their consensus network access and repurposes their combat chassis with reckless aggression.</p><p>Husked Geth retain the armor and basic combat capabilities of a standard trooper but operate without tactical networking, charging enemies in disorganized rushes. They are primarily encountered during the Reaper invasion of geth-controlled space in Mass Effect 3.</p>",
